.TH ALI-FAIL 1 "October 2026" "ALI Linux 1.5.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ali-fail \- the honest blue screen for fallen daemons
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ali-fail
.I unit
.RB ( run by systemd OnFailure, not by hand )
.SH DESCRIPTION
Fullscreen blue alert naming the dead daemon with its last log
lines. Offers Restart (gives up quietly if still dead), Full Log,
and Continue Without (acknowledges, stops the restart loop for
this boot). Odysseus gets the special truth: without it, this is
just Debian 13. Headless fallback: wall + logger.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR odysseus (8),
.BR oracle (8)
